==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~60 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 1.33~6.67 seconds<sup>40f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 1.33~6.67 seconds<sup>40f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use the same strategy you used in [[Empire of Cats]] at Chapter 1 [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]], and just kill the face as quickly as you can. Units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]] can help burst down The Face. Bring one [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attack]] unit to clean up the peons, like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]].

